  {
    "episode_id": 96064,
    "turn_file": "/shared/3/projects/podcasts/transcriptionQueue/turns/pol_appearance_episodes_interviews/9/6/96064.jsonl",
    "turn_idx": 8,
    "turn_text": "So, let's go beyond the wall of Congressman Taylor. And let's just talk about an attitude, you know, during the Trump years, there is no question. People did not feel encouraged. I'm making an attempt to come to the border because they realized they were not welcome. So they found themselves going elsewhere. So you did not have the mass flood of people come on the board. We've seen science where they've had these buying t-shirts that come, you're welcome. And some people believe that it has been the message of this administration. It was like, wait, wait. You come, we will not turn your way. Talk about that and how that could contribute to the crisis that we see today.",
